[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025803\">7040A65</a> (left and right\nsides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025278\">3380A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025833\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025804\">7040A80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025597\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025444\">5040D18</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before working on the Air Bag\nsystem follow the safety instructions for working on the system carefully\n(<a href=\"#/3025608\">5580C</a> ).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p><a href=\"#/3025613\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025802\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025611\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025282\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025799\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025570\">5550A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025590\">5560B11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025591\">5560B56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025403\">5010D56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025391\">5010C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025801\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025795\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025612\">5580C22</a></p><p>1. Working under the right side of the dashboard, undo the nuts\nfixing the bulkhead.</p><p>2. Remove the bulkhead.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005291.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts securing the dashboard trim.</p><p>2. Remove the Alfa Code aerial from the ignition barrel.</p><p>3. Remove the dashboard trim.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005292.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>If necessary, <a href=\"#/3025800\">7040A27</a></p>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the dashboard trim\nis not damaged.</p><p>If necessary, <a href=\"#/3025800\">7040A27</a></p><p>Position the dashboard trim.</p><p>Fit the Alfa Code aerial on the ignition\nbarrel.</p><p>Tighten the bolts fixing the dashboard\ntrim.</p><p>Position the bulkhead under the right side\nof the dashboard trim and secure it with the nuts.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025612\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025795\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025801\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025391\">5010C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025403\">5010D56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025591\">5560B56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025590\">5560B11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025570\">5550A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025799\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025282\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025611\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025802\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025613\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025444\">5040D18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025597\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025804\">7040A80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025833\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025278\">3380A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025803\">7040A65</a> (left\nand right sides)</p>"],[31,63,128,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025803\">7040A65</a> (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025278\">3380A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025833\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025804\">7040A80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025597\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025444\">5040D18</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before working on the Air Bag\nsystem, follow the safety instructions for working on the system\nvery carefully (See 5580C - Air Bag System - Precautions).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p><a href=\"#/3025613\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025802\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025611\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025282\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025799\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025570\">5550A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025590\">5560B11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025591\">5560B56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025403\">5010D56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025391\">5010C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025801\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025795\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025612\">5580C22</a></p><p>1. Working under the left side of the dashboard, undo the nuts fixing\nthe bulkhead.</p><p>2. Remove the bulkhead.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005293.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,128,"<p>1. Undo the bolts securing the dashboard trim.</p><p>2. Remove the Alfa Code aerial from the ignition barrel.</p><p>3. Remove the dashboard trim.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005294.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,128,"<p>If necessary, <a href=\"#/3025800\">7040A27</a></p>"],[31,63,128,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the dashboard trim is not damaged.</p><p>If necessary, <a href=\"#/3025800\">7040A27</a></p><p>Position the dashboard trim.</p><p>Fit the Alfa Code aerial on the ignition\nbarrel.</p><p>Tighten the bolts fixing the dashboard\ntrim.</p><p>Position the bulkhead under the left side\nof the dashboard trim and secure it with the nuts.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025612\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025795\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025801\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025391\">5010C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025403\">5010D56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025591\">5560B56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025590\">5560B11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025570\">5550A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025799\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025282\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025611\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025802\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025613\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025444\">5040D18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025597\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025804\">7040A80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025833\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025278\">3380A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025803\">7040A65</a> (left\nand right sides)</p>"]]